%% ACTIRA — Incident response product flow
flowchart TD
  D[Detect / Ingest] --> T[Triage incident]
  T --> A[Analyze IoCs + ATT&CK]
  A --> P[AI playbook draft]
  P --> H{HiTL required?}
  H -->|yes| R[Senior review]
  H -->|no| N[Status new / auto-approved]
  R --> AP[Approved playbook]
  R --> RJ[Rejected]
  AP --> C[Contain / Eradicate / Recover guidance]
  C --> L[Lessons learned]
  N --> C
